# One file at a time

When creating or changing this project:

- Name the single file you will add next and what it is for, in a few sentences.
- Write only that file.
- Stop. Wait until the user says to continue.
- Do not create the next file, tests, or infrastructure in the same turn.
- A question is not permission to keep building.

Go from the outside in: the client, then the Lambda, then Terraform.
